// The deterministic, audited mapping of the curated 108 launch-set records from
// docs/data/SubZeroMetrix_Resource_Directory_Master_Catalog_and_Audit.xlsx (sheet
// "Verified Launch Set") into the canonical Wave 5–6 resource architecture.
//
// IMPORTANT — this is IMPORT/AUDIT METADATA, not published runtime data:
//   - NO record is public-eligible. The workbook's "Verified - official destination identified"
//     means only that a destination was IDENTIFIED; every record's HTTP status is
//     "Not continuously monitored", so the Wave 6 active/healthy-link gate is UNMET.
//   - publicationStatus is 'held_for_review' for ALL 108. public-eligible count = 0.
//   - This module is NOT wired into getPublishedEcosystemCatalog() - the published catalog
//     stays empty. No affiliate/referral/reseller/partner status is inferred here.
//   - The 2,063-item Master Catalog backlog is NOT imported (see MASTER_CATALOG_BACKLOG_SIZE).
//   - Existing canonical IDs always win; workbook IDs are retained only as source references.
//   - Feature flags verified_launch_resources / expanded_resource_catalog /
//     tracked_resource_redirects remain default OFF - nothing is publicly activated.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

